            "notes": "Round 2 we pick up [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) and [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6). This gets us 35% ability power increasing our passive heal and the ability to have crossfade linger for 2 seconds if we need to leave the action and take care of a side quest. Essentially, if you skate through the team every few seconds, they maintain healing as though you never left.  This allows us a little more freedom of movement without leaving the squad hanging. Round 2 I always get [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) and 20% ability power however possible at BARE MINIMUM.  This build is a grower, not a shower.  Be patient if you struggle early.",
