            "notes": "This round gets us [Reverb](item_c973a6d8-47ee-4846-adb4-78f40c1b6a9f) and [All-Out Auditiva](item_7e33b7e7-4f7a-4f9f-bc25-39ce2a8f56b2). [Reverb](item_c973a6d8-47ee-4846-adb4-78f40c1b6a9f) gives us two charges of [Soundwave](ability_5ccc6ce6-cf44-4509-a720-b2e341261512) and [All-Out Auditiva](item_7e33b7e7-4f7a-4f9f-bc25-39ce2a8f56b2) increases the duration of [Amp It Up](ability_ea72cca9-6348-4221-946c-a5d2c1714a42) which, while active, doubles the healing output of [Soundwave](ability_5ccc6ce6-cf44-4509-a720-b2e341261512).  As you get settled into the play style, you'll be popping amp it up immediately prior to a double shot of soundwave giving massive doses of burst AoE Healing as well as pushing enemies off their marks.",
