            "notes": "If I can push for [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) here I do, but typically I'm just short and not willing to start wholesaling my early game setup. I enjoy [Speed Skates](item_521f3ef1-9acd-475e-8552-c6653c98cac9) for the freedom to support flankers or flee-ers while not leaving the point for long. [Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) is good for another 10% ability power while also allowing a modest 5% cooldown reduction to that [Soundwave](ability_5ccc6ce6-cf44-4509-a720-b2e341261512) driving our strategy. Survivability is an option here as well if you find yourself struggling to get out of ranged LoS.",
